WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.080
with my phone recording. The only person I saw reading the Bible was our guest, Ivan.

2
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:13.200
Now don't look so rebuked. It's one of the preacher's jobs to rebuke.

3
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.640
Have you ever considered the possibility of when you're coming to the tent,

4
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:30.240
you open your Bible, sit quietly and read it. Or open Desire of Ages, sit quietly and read it.

5
00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.960
Or just bow your head, sit quietly and pray.

6
00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:47.520
If you walked into a courtroom, you're waiting for the judge to take his or her seat.

7
00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:49.600
Is that what you'd hear in the courtroom?

8
00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:59.600
All I'm saying to you as your brother from Michigan.
